background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: sec-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 26, 300, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$accent"
      letterSpacing: 3
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 01 · 背景与问题
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 52, 848, 46]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 复杂学术查询为什么难
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 104, 848, 2]
    viewBox: [424, 1]
    points: "0,0 424,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: judgment
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 138, 848, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 21
      fontFamily: "思源宋体"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>科研检索的核心困难不是“找不到词”，而是系统<strong>理解不了“问”</strong>：</p>
        <p>复杂查询往往包含多维度约束，需要多轮探索与引文推理。</p>
  - elementId: pain1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 236, 56, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 26
      fontFamily: "思源宋体"
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 01
  - elementId: pain1-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [128, 236, 500, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 17
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 查询理解不充分
  - elementId: pain1-d
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 236, 384, 44]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 主题 / 方法 / 数据 / 时间 / venue 多维度约束难解析
  - elementId: pain1-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 286, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [424, 1]
    points: "0,0 424,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: pain2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 300, 56, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 26
      fontFamily: "思源宋体"
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 02
  - elementId: pain2-t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [128, 300, 500, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 17
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 召回与精度难平衡
  - elementId: pain2-d
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 300, 384, 44]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 高召回易混噪声，高精度易漏检
  - elementId: pain2-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 350, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [424, 1]
